		"intro": ["If AllChinaBuy is not working, first identify which part of your purchase needs attention. A page that fails to load, a seller order awaiting warehouse receipt and a parcel already accepted by a carrier are different problems. Repeatedly refreshing the homepage cannot tell you whether a specific parcel is moving. For a Romanian buyer, the useful starting point is the last record you can verify: the purchase, warehouse item or international parcel.", "On 6 October 2026, the official AllChinaBuy homepage displayed a maintenance notice attributing the interruption to an ongoing hacker attack and an upgrade process. It directed order questions to customer support but did not provide a reopening date. That observation concerns the public website; it does not establish the status of every account, app function, payment or delivery. The steps below are an editorial method for organising your evidence while access is uncertain."],
