		"intro": ["An AllChinaBuy hoodie spreadsheet is most useful when it helps you compare measurements rather than size letters. A relaxed medium from one listing can be shorter, wider or heavier than a large from another. For buyers in Romania, the decision also includes how the garment will be worn, which details need checking at the warehouse and how a bulky item affects a parcel. A low product price alone does not answer those questions.", "This article gives you a practical comparison sheet for hoodies and sweatshirts, including the Romanian search term hanorace. The numerical examples are invented to explain the method; they are not specifications for products in our catalogue. AllChinaBuy’s public homepage showed maintenance on 6 October 2026. Confirm current ordering and inspection availability before using an older guide as a description of a service you can purchase today."],
